  <book code="COL" style="id">Edolo [ETR]</book>
  <para style="rem">JG starts back translation 29 Oct 2021, finishes 10 Nov 2021.</para>
  <para style="rem">Duluba iboea 20 Fruary 2017gi dëdëi.</para>
  <para style="rem">Duluba Iboea 23 Fruary 2017gi dëdëla agui.</para>
  <para style="rem">JG starts advisor check 15 Jun 2018, Huya. Finishes 3 Jul 2018.</para>
  <para style="rem">Team advisor check review starts 18 Mar 2019, finishes 27 Mar 2019</para>
